  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>z</mi></math> be a complex number such that <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> . Then, the value of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
